# P3.T07 -- pin -> HCLK reachability on GW5AST-138C.
# Not produced by fuzz.gw5ast138c.harness's batch driver: the swept axis is the
# package ball, and ShapeSpec.pins is one dict per shape rendered once (gen.py is
# Phase 0's and frozen), so a per-sweep-point pin is not something a shape can ask
# for. The runs below went through the same gen.run -> oracle.run_oracle path the
# driver uses, one at a time, from evidence/pin-to-hclk/sweep_pin_hclk.py.

